  "part": {
    "name": "Rounded rectangular retaining and sealing frame",
    "description": "Single-piece closed rectangular frame with a large central opening, long straight rails, rounded corners, asymmetric front and rear annular lands, an inner locating wall, and a rounded outer shell. No holes, bosses, hinges, or discrete fastener mounts are present. The geometry is consistent with a bezel, gasket carrier, trim frame, or mating-part retainer.",
