      "front",
      "back",
      "left",
      "right",
      "top",
      "bottom",
      "toprightiso",
      "STEP B-rep analysis report"
    ],
    "symmetry_note": "The planform is bilaterally symmetric about the horizontal and vertical center planes and is approximately 180-degree rotationally symmetric in-plane. The through-thickness cross-section is asymmetric because the two annular lands and edge treatments differ."
  },
